An update about this subject. I received a Promise Ultra66 and this card
worked on my AS200. I will give up on the CMD649 card. If anyone is
interested, performance of the IDE disk seems to be way better than the old
SCSI disk. Looks like the AS200 is not going to be retired after all.

Thank you for everybody's help.

Andrew Gallatin writes:

